      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-06-09_WidnesExaminer_art0202" n="art0202">
        <head>ORFORD WARD VACANCY.</head>
        <p>THE ORFORD WARD VACANCY.</p>
        <p>Mr. A. Peacock and the Liberal Committee.</p>
        <p>A special meeting of the Liberal Committee of the Orford Ward was held on Tuesday evening in Silver- street school under the presidency of Councillor Wilkinson. A letter had been received from Mr. Arthur Peacock tendering his resignation as chairman of the Ward Committee. The meeting passed a vote of sym- pathy with Mr. Peacock in his trouble, expressed regret at his resignation, and thanked him for his past services. i'do Councillor Wilkinson was appointed to succeed him as chair= n.</p>
      </div>
